<title>ITALY: Italian August retail sales rose 6.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian August retail sales rose 6.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy rose 6.3 percent year-on-year in August, national statistics institute ISTAT said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990=100) was 124.0 in August against 116.7 in the same 1995 month.</p>
<p>Retail sales in the first eight months of 1996 rose 5.9 percent compared to the same period last year. -- Rome newsroom +396 678-2505</p>
